"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Authorities are working hard to rescue people trapped underground. They are using machines to dig and blast into hillsides. There is a worry that the time to save these people is running out.\",            \"english_title\": \"Rescue Efforts Underground\",            \"translated_version\": \"Las autoridades trabajan duro para rescatar a personas atrapadas bajo tierra. Usan m\u00e1quinas para cavar y explotar colinas. Hay preocupaci\u00f3n de que el tiempo para salvar a estas personas se est\u00e1 acabando.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Esfuerzos de Rescate Bajo Tierra\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A US attack on Larak Island in the Strait of Hormuz has resulted in two deaths and two injuries. This is the first known US strike since late July.\",            \"english_title\": \"US Attack on Larak Island\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un ataque de Estados Unidos en la Isla Larak en el Estrecho de Hormuz ha causado dos muertes y dos heridos. Este es el primer ataque conocido de Estados Unidos desde finales de julio.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ataque de EE.UU. en Isla Larak\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Eight people have died after a ferry began to sink shortly after leaving for Turkey. The incident has raised concerns about ferry safety.\",            \"english_title\": \"Ferry Sinks After Departure\",            \"translated_version\": \"Ocho personas han muerto despu\u00e9s de que un ferry comenz\u00f3 a hundirse poco despu\u00e9s de salir hacia Turqu\u00eda. El incidente ha generado preocupaciones sobre la seguridad de los ferris.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ferry se Hunde Tras Salida\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A 22-year-old Italian woman was killed and several others were injured at a techno rave in Aarau. The event turned tragic, and authorities are investigating.\",            \"english_title\": \"Tragedy at Techno Rave\",            \"translated_version\": \"Una mujer italiana de 22 a\u00f1os muri\u00f3 y varias personas resultaron heridas en una fiesta techno en Aarau. El evento se volvi\u00f3 tr\u00e1gico y las autoridades est\u00e1n investigando.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Tragedia en Fiesta Techno\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"President Abdelmadjid Tebboune of Algeria is considering the possibility of foul play after 100 wildfires were recorded. The situation is being closely monitored.\",            \"english_title\": \"Wildfires in Algeria\",            \"translated_version\": \"El presidente Abdelmadjid Tebboune de Argelia est\u00e1 considerando la posibilidad de juego sucio despu\u00e9s de que se registraron 100 incendios forestales. La situaci\u00f3n est\u00e1 siendo vigilada de cerca.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Incendios en Argelia\"        }    ]}"